&lt;p style="margin-left: 60px; text-align: left; text-indent: -60px"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 60px; text-align: left; text-indent: -60px"&gt;＜算定式＞&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 60px; line-height: 1; text-align: left; text-indent: -60px"&gt;
